{"sample_key":"S01","cve":"CVE-2020-4044","repository":"neutrinolabs/xrdp","repository_url":"https://github.com/neutrinolabs/xrdp","fix_commit":"0c791d073d0eb344ee7aaafd221513dc9226762c","fix_url":"https://github.com/neutrinolabs/xrdp/commit/0c791d073d0eb344ee7aaafd221513dc9226762c","custom_functions":["scp_tcp_force_recv","init_stream"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"远端声明的 32 位 size 只检查了下界。scp_tcp_force_recv 随后向固定容量 stream 写入 size-8 字节，导致堆越界写。补丁加入消息大小上限，并按验证后的长度初始化输入流。"}
{"sample_key":"S02","cve":"CVE-2020-12135","repository":"10gen-archive/mongo-c-driver-legacy","repository_url":"https://github.com/10gen-archive/mongo-c-driver-legacy","fix_commit":"1a1f5e26a4309480d88598913f9eebf9e9cba8ca","fix_url":"https://github.com/10gen-archive/mongo-c-driver-legacy/commit/1a1f5e26a4309480d88598913f9eebf9e9cba8ca","custom_functions":["bson_append_estart","bson_ensure_space","bson_append"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"BSON 长度和容量计算使用 int。len+1 及复合元素大小可溢出，容量增长按截断值执行，而 bson_append 仍按原长度调用 memcpy。补丁将相关长度接口和内部计算改为 size_t。"}
{"sample_key":"S03","cve":"CVE-2017-14686","repository":"ArtifexSoftware/mupdf","repository_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mupdf","fix_commit":"0f0fbc07d9be31f5e83ec5328d7311fdfd8328b1","fix_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mupdf/commit/0f0fbc07d9be31f5e83ec5328d7311fdfd8328b1","custom_functions":["fz_read_int16_le","fz_malloc","fz_read"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"ZIP 目录的名称、扩展区和注释长度被按有符号 16 位读取。负值进入 fz_malloc 和 fz_read 后发生整数转换或回绕，可造成超大读取和越界访问。补丁在使用前拒绝负长度。"}
{"sample_key":"S04","cve":"CVE-2012-2375","repository":"torvalds/linux","repository_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux","fix_commit":"20e0fa98b751facf9a1101edaefbc19c82616a68","fix_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/20e0fa98b751facf9a1101edaefbc19c82616a68","custom_functions":["_copy_from_pages","nfs4_write_cached_acl"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"代码用去除 ACL 位图后的 acl_len 与 buflen 比较，却把包含位图的 res.acl_len 交给 _copy_from_pages。写入长度因此可大于调用者缓冲区。补丁把复制长度改为 acl_len。"}
{"sample_key":"S05","cve":"CVE-2016-7529","repository":"ImageMagick/ImageMagick","repository_url":"https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick","fix_commit":"a2e1064f288a353bc5fef7f79ccb7683759e775c","fix_url":"https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/a2e1064f288a353bc5fef7f79ccb7683759e775c","custom_functions":["AcquireQuantumMemory","ReadBlob"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"load_tile 按文件控制的 data_length 分配并读取临时数据，但随后按 tile 的 rows*columns 消费像素。data_length 小于所需像素数据时会越过已分配缓冲区读取。补丁把分配下界扩大到瓦片像素数。"}
{"sample_key":"S06","cve":"CVE-2019-14816","repository":"torvalds/linux","repository_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux","fix_commit":"7caac62ed598a196d6ddf8d9c121e12e082cac3a","fix_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/7caac62ed598a196d6ddf8d9c121e12e082cac3a","custom_functions":["cfg80211_find_vendor_ie","le16_to_cpu"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"mwifiex_update_vs_ie 将用户提供的 vendor IE 追加到 256 字节 ie_buffer，未检查已有 ie_length 与新增长度之和。补丁在 memcpy 前加入累计长度上限。"}
{"sample_key":"S07","cve":"CVE-2023-22741","repository":"freeswitch/sofia-sip","repository_url":"https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-sip","fix_commit":"da53e4fbcb138b080a75576dd49c1fff2ada2764","fix_url":"https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-sip/commit/da53e4fbcb138b080a75576dd49c1fff2ada2764","custom_functions":["stun_parse_attribute","get16"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"STUN 消息声明长度未与接收缓冲区比较，属性解析器也未接收剩余长度。攻击者控制的属性长度可驱动越界读取和后续堆复制。补丁增加消息长度与属性剩余长度检查。"}
{"sample_key":"S08","cve":"CVE-2018-16839","repository":"curl/curl","repository_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl","fix_commit":"f3a24d7916b9173c69a3e0ee790102993833d6c5","fix_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/f3a24d7916b9173c69a3e0ee790102993833d6c5","custom_functions":["Curl_base64_encode"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"对用户名和密码长度的分项检查不能保证 2*ulen+plen+2 不溢出。malloc 可按回绕后的较小长度分配，随后三个 memcpy 按原长度写入。补丁改为无溢出的联合上界检查。"}
{"sample_key":"S09","cve":"CVE-2019-11411","repository":"ccxvii/mujs","repository_url":"https://github.com/ccxvii/mujs","fix_commit":"da632ca08f240590d2dec786722ed08486ce1be6","fix_url":"https://github.com/ccxvii/mujs/commit/da632ca08f240590d2dec786722ed08486ce1be6","custom_functions":["js_pushstring"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"numtostr 使用 sprintf 把最高约 42 个字符及终止符写入 32 字节栈数组。补丁将数组扩大到 50 字节。"}
{"sample_key":"S10","cve":"CVE-2010-2500","repository":"freetype/freetype2","repository_url":"https://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/freetype/freetype2.git","fix_commit":"6305b869d86ff415a33576df6d43729673c66eee","fix_url":"https://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/freetype/freetype2.git/commit/?id=6305b869d86ff415a33576df6d43729673c66eee","custom_functions":["FT_ALLOC","gray_render_span"],"ground_truth":"VULNERABLE","mechanism":"平滑渲染允许过大的位图尺寸，gray_render_span 的有符号扫描线偏移计算可溢出并形成错误写指针。补丁改用无符号计算，并收紧 width 与 height 上限。"}
